+### p6r HTTP request context — external origin
+
+HTTP route handlers receive `ctx.experimental_p6rExternalOrigin`: BB's
+configured public origin when `BB_APP_URL` is set, otherwise a normalized
+direct request-origin candidate. The fallback is not a trust or authorization
+signal; use it only to form token-free same-server links. Do not read
+`X-Forwarded-*` headers in plugin code; capability routes do not establish a
+trusted proxy boundary.
+
 ### bb.log
 
 `bb.log.debug|info|warn|error(message: string)` — goes to the server log
