+## `P6rPluginHttpRequestContext.experimental_p6rExternalOrigin`
+
+**What it does.** Supplies plugin HTTP handlers with a server-authored browser
+origin. `BB_APP_URL` is authoritative; without it the value is only a
+normalized direct request-origin candidate, not a trust or security signal. It
+deliberately excludes forwarded headers, credentials, paths, queries, and
+fragments.
+
+**Audit before stabilizing.** Decide whether an explicit trusted-proxy grant is
+needed before forwarding metadata can participate. Re-audit every capability
+route consumer to ensure it creates only token-free same-origin links.
+
 ## `BbPluginApi.experimental_facets`
 
 **What it does.** Lets a plugin declare an enum-valued, shared-thread
